# Agent worktrees. This was previously an ENUMERATED list of three generated names
# (romantic-franklin, cranky-margulis, strange-gagarin) — i.e. default-uncovered: the
# fourth worktree, created tomorrow, would have been committed. Exactly the
# "scope never reaches it" vacuity shape from docs/standards/non-vacuity.md.
# The directory itself is transient state; the tracked agent config next to it
# (.claude/commands/, .claude/skills/) is shared tooling and stays committed.
.claude/worktrees/

