# --- Per-developer agent + environment state ---------------------------------
# These are machine-local. Tracking them leaks one developer's session state and
# credentials into everyone else's checkout; worse, the values (local DB UUIDs,
# user_model_ids, ports) are meaningless elsewhere and actively mislead.
# The SHARED counterparts stay committed on purpose:
#   .claude/commands/, .claude/skills/  — team tooling
#   .raid/active-task.yaml              — read by scripts/raid/task_config.py, per-branch by design
#   .mcp.json, .cursor/.mcp.json        — placeholder tokens only, no secrets

# Agent session memory / rolling notes (remember plugin).
.remember/

